# geometry directory instructions

Directory to house tri-surfaces

## what is this directory for?
The snappyHexMeshDict command will read the combined.stl file from this folder and create the combined.eMesh file

## New mesh
To replace with new mesh, rename the new file to combined.stl and replace the old combined.stl file to other name

## How to run
nothing to run here
the upper dir Allrun script will run the snappyHexMesh command